		CASE 18
			PRINTFORML 「Munya-munya...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I couldn't quite sleep last night, so I'm a little drowsy...」
		CASE 19
			PRINTFORML 「Seems like there's a lot of commotion in the Human Village these days, I wonder what's going on.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Me? I d-definitely don't know anything about it!」
		CASE 20
			PRINTFORML 「I heard there is a sacred land for werewolves called "Kessig" in the Outside World.」
			PRINTFORMW 「But there are no werewolves outside of Gensokyo, so they must be long gone by now.」
