			PRINTFORML 「Um, I don't know if I should be saying this now, but...」
			PRINTFORML 「Please don't tell anyone in the Human Village I'm a werewolf.」
			PRINTFORMW 「It's a matter of life and death for me, you know.」
		CASE 26
			PRINTFORML 「It looks like the recently built temple is enjoying a lot of success.」
